    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but it doesnt feel like that. it feels like i'm just playing a part in a movie that's already ended. every single thing i do feels fake because he isnt here to see it. it's like i'm just waiting for my body to realize it's supposed to be gone too. does that even make sense? that i just feel like i don't belong in this world anymore?",
